'''Legend Stages''' (レジェンドストーリー, ''Rejendo Sutōrī'', '''Legend Story''') is a game mode that is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 and was released in the [[Version 2.0 Update]] of [[The Battle Cats]]. It contains the [[Higher Score|Challenge Battle]], the [[Enigma Stages]], many new sub-chapters (each with 1-8 stages), new types of enemies, and new game mechanics, but also [[Special Events|Event Stages]] and [[Collaboration Events]] where the player can win unique rewards, such as [[:Category:Monthly Events|Monthly Events]] (collectible units), [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stages]] ([[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal cats]]), [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stages]] (a variety of specialized cats), [[:Category:Crazed Cat Stages|Crazed Cat Stages]] (powerful variants of [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]), and [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stages]] ([[True Form]]s of certain cats), among many others.

These challenges wait for the bravest players to come. It is recommended to get [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] before starting these stages. Later, [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] and [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] will be essential to progress further into the Stories of Legend and special stages. The production cost of all cats in this mode is the same as in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 2 and the other [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] outside of Empire of Cats Chapters 1 & 3.
__TOC__

==Story==
After [[Empire of Cats]], the Cats made a time machine to travel back in time before [[The Cat God (Special Cat)|The Cat God]] was born (in [[BCEN]], he's a millennial; in [[BCJP]], he was born in the [[wikipedia:Heisei era|Heisei era]]), rescue [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] sealed away by a certain organization, and collect [[Cat Food]]. The journey reaches its end in an [[Laboratory of Relics|ancient laboratory]] where [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossi]] are created, [[Relic Doge]]s are stored, and a certain organization seeks to awaken ancient power. There, the Cats defeat the last Mythic Cats and add them to their army: [[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]], which was revived by the dark organization; and the mystery lifeform [[Idi:Re]], who wreaks havoc across the lab in the [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|true final fight]]. After completing their goals and returning to the present, however, the Cats soon find themselves having to travel even further back into the past as they realize the Mythic Cats unlocked in Stories of Legend were merely descendants of the real heroes of Legend (i.e., [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Urs]] is implied to be an ancestor of [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun]]).

In the ancient past, the Cats find themselves facing more enemies of the [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] trait they had briefly seen in the Laboratory of Relics, including the ancient guardian [[Relic Bun-Bun]], and later the True Mythic Cats they were seeking. After freeing the True Mythic Cats, they defeat and befriend [[Great Ape Luza|humanity's]] [[Zero Luza|ancestor]], but before they return home, someone claiming to be an ancient god appears from a [[Sacred Forest|golden tree]], tells them to find a [[:Category:Sage Enemies|sage]] in another world, then leaves while drawing a golden can of [[Cat Food]] in a swirling maelstrom of energy in the sky. The Cats then travel to another world, the dimension-transcending "Zero World," to try to find the sage and even more Cat Food.

When revisiting [[Ancient Forest Labyrinth]], the Cats defeat another mysterious entity—[[Idi:Ne]], her master's wish for a perfect lifeform close to being realized—then use her data to transform Idi:N. Later, Idi:Ne's master is heavily implied to be the true final boss of Uncanny Legends, [[Sage of Life Dr. Nova]], an ambitious researcher who sought to create life that would transcend humanity. Dr. Nova had previously helped the Cats in the Sacred Forest by guiding them to the other dimension, but then lost her ego to the Sage stone she was studying, betraying the returning Cats in a [[Revival of Origin/Invasion|Sacred Forest deprived of all life energy]].

[[The Cat God]] is not usable in any Legend Stage due to this mode taking place before his birth, although [[God (Special Cat)|God]] and [[Cat God the Great (Special Cat)|Cat God the Great]] can still be used.

