| colspan="2" |'''Zero Legends''' (レジェンドストーリー0, ''Rejendo Sutōrī 0'', '''Legend Story 0''') is the third main campaign in Legend Stages, unlocked by completing Uncanny Legends on 1-Crown difficulty. It can be accessed from the Legend Stages menu at any time and was added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]] of [[The Battle Cats]].

Like the final chapter of the previous campaign, the first sub-chapter, [[Zero Field]], only contains one level. Completing this level unlocks [[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Filibuster Cat X]]'s [[True Form]].

Zero Legends has a much wider variety of enemies than the previous sub-chapters, featuring many former event-exclusive enemies such as [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoths]], [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s, [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]], [[Heavenly Tower]] bosses, and even monthly/seasonal event enemies like [[Le'mammoth]] and [[Bears Be Back]].

In sub-chapter 9, [[Garden of Wilted Thoughts]], Zero Legends introduces a brand new enemy type: [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]]. Sage is a unique typing that works like [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossal]] and [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]], but also has the gimmick of resisting most special effects inflicted by [[Cat Units]], with the exception of [[:Category:Sage Slayer Cats|Sage Slayers]].

As of [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]], all Zero Legends stages drop Extra-Dimensional Materials, which are needed for [[Ototo Corps|Ototo]] to upgrade [[Cat Base]] Foundations and Styles.

