==Other Permanent Stages==
*[[Higher Score|Challenge Battle]]: Unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. An easy enough stage where you can test units and aim to beat your high score at no cost of energy, it also introduces two enemies: [[Shy Boy]] and [[Assassin Bear]]. Though listed under "Special Stages", Challenge Battle is considered its own type of stage rather than a typical event, and as such was the only repeatable stage until the 15.2 update over 10 Years later.
*[[Growing Catfruit]]: Unlocked after clearing Empire of Cats Chapter 3. The main source of Green, Purple, Red, Blue and Yellow [[Catfruit]] and their Seeds, as well as Epic Catfruit (but not Epic Catfruit Seeds). It has five stages, each dropping a specific color of Catfruit/Seed and having a chance to be followed by the [[Continuation Stage]] [[Catfruit Jubilee]].
The following stages are permanent only in the sense that they do not have a time limit like other [[Event Stages]]—they disappear after the player completes them.
*[[The Gates of Aku|Unleashing the Cats]]: Unlocked after clearing [[Wicked Cat]], [[Wicked Tank]] and [[Wicked Axe]]. Beating this stage unlocks [[The Aku Realms]] as well as Uncanny Legends sub-chapter 39, [[Imminent Disaster]], making it a required part of game progression.
*[[Valkyrie Cat's Trial]]: Unlocked after clearing [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 1. Grants access to [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]]'s [[Talents]] upon being cleared.
*[[Bahamut Cat's Trial]]: Unlocked after clearing Cats of the Cosmos Chapter 2 and Valkyrie Cat's Trial. Grants access to [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]'s Talents upon being cleared.

